<title>USA: USDA offers Egypt GSM credit on cotton yarn, fabric.</title>
<headline>USDA offers Egypt GSM credit on cotton yarn, fabric.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday it was including 100 percent cotton yarn and fabric among the items available for sale to Egypt through its export credit guarantee program.</p>
<p>Total of GSM-102 short-term credits earmarked for Egypt in fiscal 1997 remained at $200 million. Of that, $100 million has been allocated.</p>
</text>
